WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.274
This is The Language Page:

00:00:02.274 --> 00:00:07.057
interactive English practice for multilingual learners, teachers, and families.

00:00:07.457 --> 00:00:09.889
Pick a grade, and start practicing in minutes.

00:00:11.139 --> 00:00:15.747
Explore the four language domains: listening, speaking, reading, and writing.

00:00:16.147 --> 00:00:20.350
Each has its own studio, with activities built around the language of school.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:25.187
Or step into games and worlds, where every mission practices real language.

00:00:26.437 --> 00:00:31.216
Every activity moves through four steps: warm up, learn, try, and reflect.

00:00:31.616 --> 00:00:35.712
Listen again, or slower. Open word help in English and Spanish.

00:00:37.512 --> 00:00:40.179
Choose an answer, say how sure you are, and check it.

00:00:41.978 --> 00:00:45.135
You get specific feedback right away, with a next step.

00:00:45.536 --> 00:00:47.947
Learn with help, or try it independently.

00:00:48.346 --> 00:00:51.671
Want ACCESS-style practice? Open the Access Prep hub,

00:00:51.671 --> 00:00:54.682
with practice tests and an assessment simulator.

00:00:55.932 --> 00:00:58.805
Your Growth Map shows evidence of what you can do,

00:00:58.805 --> 00:01:00.988
and what to practice next, not scores.

00:01:01.388 --> 00:01:04.778
Teachers can start with one real activity for each domain,

00:01:04.778 --> 00:01:06.999
and students choose the help they use.

00:01:07.399 --> 00:01:11.943
Families can practice together, with directions in English, Spanish, or both.

00:01:13.193 --> 00:01:16.094
One place to build English skills, at your own pace.

00:01:16.494 --> 00:01:19.737
The Language Page. Start at thelanguagepage.com.
